# --- Secrets and credentials ------------------------------------------------
# Note: the bare `.env` pattern only matches a file named exactly ".env".
# `*.env` is needed to cover `secrets.env`, `prod.env`, etc.
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
secrets*
credentials*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*

# --- Artifacts produced by quality-team at runtime --------------------------
# The skill writes its intermediate files into the project being analyzed.
.claude/quality-team/
REFACTOR_REPORT.md

# --- Local Claude Code settings (personal, machine-specific) ----------------
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
